# M18 "Kuşanma" (docs/PROTOCOL_EQUIPMENT.md §6), flow "m18_swing" run "rogue" (Ortaocak; MonsterAttack = 25): a
# level-1 rogue with its two hunting daggers (1200 ms: a ~0.5 s flick, state swingfast) fights a Kül Çömezi; a
# burst of close side views through its quick swings; the combat log prints the tempo.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m18_swing_r
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.2
clickon create.name
text Cevikce
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+statsknown 1800
waitfor world+nobanner 400
scene expectderived speed 1.2
scene expectderived reach 2.2
waitfor world+monsters 600
scene walktomonster Kül Çömezi 9
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene target nearest Kül Çömezi
key f
waitfor world+attacking+swings2+swingfast 900
scene camera side 6 2.2
waitfor world+swings3 300
screenshot 01_dagger_swing_a.png
wait 6
screenshot 02_dagger_swing_b.png
wait 6
screenshot 03_dagger_swing_c.png
wait 6
screenshot 04_dagger_swing_d.png
scene combatlog
waitfor world+kills1 1800
scene combatlog
quit
